{
 "total": 71.119,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "v": "hook_flute",
   "start": 0.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Someone in the Stone Age made a flute from a vulture's wing bone.",
     "start": 0.6,
     "end": 4.041
    },
    {
     "text": "And it's at least thirty-five thousand years old.",
     "start": 4.361,
     "end": 6.608
    }
   ],
   "end": 6.978
  },
  {
   "v": "hook_q",
   "start": 6.978,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So what did cavemen do for fun?",
     "start": 7.278,
     "end": 9.037
    }
   ],
   "end": 9.407
  },
  {
   "v": "meet_moss",
   "start": 9.407,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Meet Moss. He's bored.",
     "start": 9.707,
     "end": 11.068
    }
   ],
   "end": 11.438
  },
  {
   "v": "flute_cave",
   "start": 11.438,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise one: music.",
     "start": 11.738,
     "end": 13.172
    },
    {
     "text": "Found in Hohle Fels cave, Germany, it has five finger holes.",
     "start": 13.492,
     "end": 17.088
    }
   ],
   "end": 17.458
  },
  {
   "v": "flute_replica",
   "start": 17.458,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Experts carved a copy from vulture bone.",
     "start": 17.758,
     "end": 19.969
    },
    {
     "text": "And yes, it plays.",
     "start": 20.289,
     "end": 21.413
    }
   ],
   "end": 21.783
  },
  {
   "v": "finger_flutings",
   "start": 21.783,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise two: kids' doodles.",
     "start": 22.083,
     "end": 23.827
    },
    {
     "text": "In Rouffignac cave, France, over thirteen thousand years ago, children dragged fingers through soft clay.",
     "start": 24.147,
     "end": 30.147
    }
   ],
   "end": 30.517
  },
  {
   "v": "lifted_up",
   "start": 30.517,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Some lines reach the ceiling.",
     "start": 30.817,
     "end": 32.468
    },
    {
     "text": "Scientists think grown-ups lifted them up.",
     "start": 32.788,
     "end": 35.04
    }
   ],
   "end": 35.41
  },
  {
   "v": "hand_stencils",
   "start": 35.41,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise three: tiny hands.",
     "start": 35.71,
     "end": 37.494
    },
    {
     "text": "In Spanish caves, maybe a quarter of hand outlines are children's.",
     "start": 37.814,
     "end": 41.485
    }
   ],
   "end": 41.855
  },
  {
   "v": "stencil_how",
   "start": 41.855,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Paint was blown around a hand on the wall.",
     "start": 42.155,
     "end": 44.263
    },
    {
     "text": "Like a Stone Age selfie.",
     "start": 44.583,
     "end": 46.099
    }
   ],
   "end": 46.469
  },
  {
   "v": "fire_stories",
   "start": 46.469,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Surprise four: stories.",
     "start": 46.769,
     "end": 48.235
    },
    {
     "text": "Among Kalahari hunter-gatherers today, most long fireside chats at night are stories.",
     "start": 48.555,
     "end": 53.52
    }
   ],
   "end": 53.89
  },
  {
   "v": "dance",
   "start": 53.89,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "There's singing and dancing too.",
     "start": 54.19,
     "end": 55.852
    },
    {
     "text": "It's a modern clue, but a lovely one.",
     "start": 56.172,
     "end": 58.181
    }
   ],
   "end": 58.551
  },
  {
   "v": "ending",
   "start": 58.551,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So Stone Age fun sounds like ours.",
     "start": 58.851,
     "end": 61.013
    },
    {
     "text": "Music. Messy art. A really good story.",
     "start": 61.333,
     "end": 63.797
    }
   ],
   "end": 64.167
  },
  {
   "v": "moss_flute",
   "start": 64.167,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And Moss? Still can't play the flute.",
     "start": 64.467,
     "end": 66.394
    }
   ],
   "end": 66.764
  },
  {
   "v": "follow",
   "start": 66.764,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Follow for more Stone Age Stories.",
     "start": 67.064,
     "end": 68.949
    }
   ],
   "end": 71.119
  }
 ]
}